OL,3,ADozens of gold prospectors killed in
OL,4,Astrikes on Egypt-Sudan border, rights
OL,5,Agroup says
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 72 civilians who had been
OL,8,Fprospecting for gold in a border region
OL,9,Fof Sudan have been killed in air
OL,10,Fstrikes, a regional rights group says.
OL,12,FEmergency Lawyers, based in the
OL,13,FSudanese capital, Khartoum, said jets
OL,14,Ftargeted the so-called artisanal miners
OL,15,Fat a popular gold mining sites in
OL,16,FSudan's River Nile state on Saturday.
OL,18,FNeither the Egyptian government nor the
OL,19,Fde facto Sudanese authorities have so
OL,20,Ffar commented.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
